        "text": "<thinking> To implement the file 'query_metric_window.py' that queries recent datapoints for a named metric over a time window, I need to select a concrete external provider for metrics monitoring. I will use the Amazon CloudWatch service for this task, as it is a widely used service for monitoring metrics and provides a comprehensive API for querying metrics. The code will include the import of the Boto3 library, which is the Amazon Web Services (AWS) SDK for Python, to interact with the CloudWatch service. This will make the provider identifiable in the code. </thinking>\n",
